<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank 3mo bill auction attracts no bids.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank 3mo bill auction attracts no bids.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) on Wednesday said its Dutch-style auction of an unspecified tranche of its three-month liquidity bills attracted no bids.</p>
<p>In its last successful auction of similar bills on August 28, the NBS set the yield at 9.3 percent after 9.3 percent on August 21.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-210-3687</p>
